","Matt Letscher","Jon Lindstrom","Ryan Sands","Jaime Alvarez","Michael Flores","Lilli Birdsell","Tava Smiley","Stephen Snedden","Rebecca Wisocky","Tom Wright","Tate Ellington","Chad Michael Collins","Elya Baskin","Juan Gabriel Pareja","Cliff Simon","David Marciano","Jared Kusnitz","Jeffrey Nordling","Jacqueline MacInnes Wood","David Harris","Keith Szarabajka","Dale Midkiff","Matt Roth","Molly Hagan","Angela Relucio","Kim Johnston Ulrich","Will Rothhaar","Jessica Camacho","Nathan Anderson","Jake Martin","Nick Jandl","Krista Allen","Geno Segers","Paul Ben-Victor","Vincent Spano","Larry Poindexter","Mo Gallini","Jackie Tohn","Beau Billingslea","Tim Griffin","Alimi Ballard","Heather McComb","Kim Hawthorne","Jackson Hurst","Erick Lopez","Nazneen Contractor","Kamar de los Reyes","Adam Wylie","Valorie Hubbard","Ivan Sergei","Audrey Marie Anderson","Brianna Brown","India de Beaufort","Amy Rosoff","Summer Glau","Jamie McBride","Tony Nevada","David Clayton Rogers","Sterling K. Brown","Dilshad Vadsaria","Assaf Cohen","Gwendoline Yeo","Konstantin Lavyš","Matthew Marsden","Maxwell Caulfield","Yves Bright","Linda Park","Susan Park","Rosalind Chao","Hector Luis Bustamante","Joe Sabatino","Roz Witt","Ricardo Chavira","David Conrad","David Andrews","Charlie Hofheimer","Reiko Aylesworth","Ali Hillis","Edelyn Okano","Don McManus","Brian McNamara","Meredith Monroe","Nikki DeLoach","Brina Palencia","Elena Nikitina Bick","Usman Ally","Mackenzie Astin","Agnes Olech","Paula Newsome","Josh Dean","Inbar Lavi","Lisa Kaminir","Roy Werner","Christian Gehring","Gregory Harrison"],"screenwriters":["Andrew W. Marlowe","Alexi Hawley","Will Beall","Shalisha Francis","Christine Boylan","Gabrielle G. Stanton","René Echevarria","Chad Gomez Creasey","Dara Resnik Creasey","Jose Molina","David Amann","Elizabeth Beall","Marc Dube","Charles Murray","Barry Schindel","Terri Edda Miller","Kate Sargeant","Nancy Kiu","Jim Adler","Moira Kirland","Jason Wilborn","Stephanie Hicks","Barry O'Brien","Rob Hanning","Terence Paul Winter","Matt Pyken","David Grae","Scott Williams"],"cinematographers":["Daryn Okada","Michael Slovis","Bill Roe","Roger Simonsz"],"composers":["Mark Kilian","Robert Duncan"],"reviews":[{"author":"hroubek","text":"Moje největší seriálová závislost v současnosti. Pamatuji si první díl, kterým si mě Castle a spol. získal a od té doby jsem mu propadl. Dostal jsem desítky dobrých epizod, super hlášky, napětí, romantiku, buddy-movie, prostě parádní oddechovou podívanou se sympatickými herci. Škoda úpadku kvality u posledních dvou řad, protože první šest sérií jsou luxus.(04.08.2014)","stars":5},{"author":"Nevada","text":"Krimi seriál založený spíše na interakci hlavních postav než na samotném vyšetřování. Výborná zábava, pokud neočekáváte \"vědeckou\" kriminálku ve stylu CSI.Nathan Fillionje neskutečně charismatický a roli úspěšného a chytrého spisovatele, trousícího jednu hlášku za druhou, si vyloženě užívá. Scény, kde detektivům popisuje jak by se zločiny odehrály v jeho románech patří k nejlepším okamžikům seriálu.Stana Katicje k němu vybraná výborně, zdatně mu sekunduje a krásně to mezi nimi jiskří. Pozadu nezůstává ani spisovatelova rodina – vzorná dcera i potrhlá matka. Škoda poměrně velké nevyužitosti dvojice detektivů Ryan/Espozito.(05.05.2009)","stars":5},{"author":"kikuka","text":"Je funky sledovať vlastne variáciu na X-Files, teda, čo sa týka postáv: racionálne a logicky situovaná ženská postava, oproti nej \"fikcionalista\", dvaja spoluhráči a dokopy fasa tím. Šarmantné, vtipné, hravé, chytľavé bez toho, že by si robilo srandu z prípadov, ktoré sú predmetom vyšetrovania, nech sú už akokoľvek bizarné. Som naozaj zvedavá, ako dlho sa podarí udržať hranu medzi hlavnými postavami iskrivú a do akých rozmerov mi Nathan popriberá.(01.01.2012)","stars":5}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-30fb4e12-5a72-4fe6-85ff-ddb5e88d1a65"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/252683-castle-na-zabiti/prehled/","csfd_id":252683,"root_id":252683,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":8,"episode_count":173,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null}